              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni hagira inka yica umugabo cank’ umugore, agashika, iyo nka ntiz’ ibure kwicishwa amabuye, kandi ntiz’ iribge; ariko nyene yo ntaz’ ashirwe mu rukinja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
